Modifications by TheSkyC in 2026:
- Allow screenshots and screen recording; remove the multitasking privacy toggle
  (original local commit 5084b77d0d9e11c85147220880477201a22e905f,
  replayed after NReader initialization).
- Rename the project, application labels, APKs, storage directory, and user agent
  to NReader; give the installed application its own application ID.
- Start the independent NReader version sequence at 1.0.0.
- Add NReader maintainer and upstream attribution in documentation and Settings.
- Package LICENSE and NOTICE with the application.
- Make release signing optional for development and use local fork credentials.
- Disable APK updates and bug-report links until fork destinations are configured.
- Adapt CI and security-reporting documentation for independent maintenance.
- Define Git line-ending normalization and binary-file attributes.

